OL,3,GNEWSAHorsham Museum to close for four
OL,4,Amonths
OL,5,
OL,6,FA museum in West Sussex will be closed
OL,7,Ffor four months to allow for essential
OL,8,Frepairs of its roof to be undertaken.
OL,10,FThe Horsham Museum and Art Gallery will
OL,11,Fbe closed from 7 September until 5
OL,12,FJanuary next year after specialist
OL,13,Fcontractors found that sections of the
OL,14,Fstonework had deteriorated.
OL,16,FAs a Grade II listed building, the
OL,17,Fmuseum requires specialist conservation
OL,18,Fwork which can only be achieved with a
OL,19,Fclosure, Horsham District Council said.
OL,23,APub: 23-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
