OL,3,GNEWSAHorsham Museum to close for four
OL,4,Amonths
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe council's deputy leader Mark
OL,7,FBaynham said the repairs were "vital to
OL,8,Fprotect our visitors, staff,
OL,9,Fcollections and this important historic
OL,10,Fbuilding".
